  "E10 arm E (review r5): profile pi4cpu_half; limits {'cpus': '0.5', 'memory': '512m', 'device_read_bps': '40mb', 'device_write_bps': '10mb', 'device': '/dev/vda'} plus ['--memory-swap', '512m', '--device-read-iops', '/dev/vda:1500', '--device-write-iops', '/dev/vda:500']; assumed values: as pi4",
